  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OUR RIGHTS OUR LIVES OUR FUTURE PHASE 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our Rights, Our Lives, Our Future, seeks to improve sexual and reproductive health, gender and education outcomes for adolescents and young people in the Sub-Saharan Africa region and sustained reductions in new HIV/STI infections, early and unintended pregnancy and gender-based violence by a) securing and sustaining strong political commitment and support for adolescents and young people&#x2019;s access to comprehensive sexuality education (CSE) and sexual and reproductive health services across Sub- Saharan Africa; (b) supporting the delivery of accurate, rights-based and good quality comprehensive sexuality education programmes; (c) ensuring that schools and community environments are safer, healthier and inclusive for all young people; and (d) strengthening the evidence base on CSE and safer school environments.</narrative>
  </description>
